    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d122-a1">

                <pb facs="0214" n="134" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg134"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Goodnow.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-12-11"><hi rendition="#italic">December 11,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith a copy of a dispatch
                    from Viceroy Liu at Nankin to the Chinese minister at Washington regarding
                    disturbances at Hsin-Chin caused by ill feeling between Protestant and Roman
                    Catholic converts there.</p>
                <p>I request that you will carefully investigate this matter and report the
                    circumstances of the case fully to this legation as soon as possible.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
